{"id":"5e3111fd9385df4f","group":"88","path":"88/88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence.md","title":"Existence and Uniqueness of the Jump Hierarchy","display":"lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence — Existence and Uniqueness of the Jump Hierarchy","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence","aliases":["88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence"],"display":"lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence — Existence and Uniqueness of the Jump Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[88-df-hyperarithmetical-def]]","[[88-df-ordinal-notation]]","[[88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties]]","[[88-df-jump-operator-def]]","[[88-df-effective-join]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence — Existence and Uniqueness of the Jump Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6587ae27f7ed289f\" href=\"?note=6587ae27f7ed289f\" title=\"88-df-hyperarithmetical-def\">88-df-hyperarithmetical-def</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b23177f17eeaa7a2\" href=\"?note=b23177f17eeaa7a2\" title=\"88-df-ordinal-notation\">88-df-ordinal-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"17e23d087321028e\" href=\"?note=17e23d087321028e\" title=\"88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties\">88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c749f46fbad31f8b\" href=\"?note=c749f46fbad31f8b\" title=\"88-df-jump-operator-def\">88-df-jump-operator-def</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"20e88b72affa35d1\" href=\"?note=20e88b72affa35d1\" title=\"88-df-effective-join\">88-df-effective-join</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}\">\\(\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6587ae27f7ed289f\" href=\"?note=6587ae27f7ed289f\" title=\"88-df-hyperarithmetical-def\">88-df-hyperarithmetical-def</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_{88},|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}},\\varphi_e\">\\(\\mathcal O_{88},|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}},\\varphi_e\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b23177f17eeaa7a2\" href=\"?note=b23177f17eeaa7a2\" title=\"88-df-ordinal-notation\">88-df-ordinal-notation</a>；良基秩和构造子分析见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"17e23d087321028e\" href=\"?note=17e23d087321028e\" title=\"88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties\">88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c749f46fbad31f8b\" href=\"?note=c749f46fbad31f8b\" title=\"88-df-jump-operator-def\">88-df-jump-operator-def</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigoplus\">\\(\\bigoplus\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"20e88b72affa35d1\" href=\"?note=20e88b72affa35d1\" title=\"88-df-effective-join\">88-df-effective-join</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H,\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal H,\\mathcal K\\)</span> 为候选函数图；背景采用 ZFC 的良基递归定理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}existence}\\vdash\n\\exists!\\mathcal H\\;\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}existence}\\vdash\n\\exists!\\mathcal H\\;\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}existence}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal H,\\mathcal K\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)\\land\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal K)\n\\to\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;\\mathcal H(a)=\\mathcal K(a)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}existence}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal H,\\mathcal K\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)\\land\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal K)\n\\to\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;\\mathcal H(a)=\\mathcal K(a)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>存在性。每个记号恰属零、后继或极限三类之一。后继子句只调用严格较小秩的前驱；极限子句调用的每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(k)\">\\(\\varphi_e(k)\\)</span> 也有严格较小秩。由此按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\">\\(|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\)</span> 作良基递归，同时为同秩但不同的记号分别赋值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 和已定义的有效直和都把所需输入唯一地变成自然数集合，替换公理给出定义域为整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_{88}\">\\(\\mathcal O_{88}\\)</span> 的函数图。</p>\n<p>唯一性。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H,\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal H,\\mathcal K\\)</span> 均满足子句，对记号秩作超限归纳。零层一致；后继层由前驱一致及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 的函数性一致；极限层的每一列先由归纳假设一致，再由直和的定义一致。因此两函数逐点相等。此证明不要求同一序数的不同记号具有字面相同的层。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-hyperarithmetical-def","status":"resolved","id":"6587ae27f7ed289f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-hyperarithmetical-def]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ordinal-notation","status":"resolved","id":"b23177f17eeaa7a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ordinal-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties","status":"resolved","id":"17e23d087321028e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-jump-operator-def","status":"resolved","id":"c749f46fbad31f8b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-jump-operator-def]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-join","status":"resolved","id":"20e88b72affa35d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-effective-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-hyperarithmetical-def","status":"resolved","id":"6587ae27f7ed289f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}$ 见 [[88-df-hyperarithmetical-def]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ordinal-notation","status":"resolved","id":"b23177f17eeaa7a2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal O_{88},|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}},\\varphi_e$ 见 [[88-df-ordinal-notation]]；良基秩和构造子分析见 [[88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties","status":"resolved","id":"17e23d087321028e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal O_{88},|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}},\\varphi_e$ 见 [[88-df-ordinal-notation]]；良基秩和构造子分析见 [[88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-jump-operator-def","status":"resolved","id":"c749f46fbad31f8b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J$ 见 [[88-df-jump-operator-def]]；$\\bigoplus$ 见 [[88-df-effective-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-join","status":"resolved","id":"20e88b72affa35d1","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J$ 见 [[88-df-jump-operator-def]]；$\\bigoplus$ 见 [[88-df-effective-join]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_{88},|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}},\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigoplus","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H,\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}existence}\\vdash\n\\exists!\\mathcal H\\;\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}existence}\\vdash\n\\forall\\mathcal H,\\mathcal K\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)\\land\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal K)\n\\to\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;\\mathcal H(a)=\\mathcal K(a)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi_e(k)","display":false},{"tex":"|a|_{\\mathcal O_{88}}","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_{88}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H,\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false}],"bytes":2187,"backlinks":[{"id":"6587ae27f7ed289f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这里仅定义“满足递归子句”的性质。系统存在唯一性由 [[88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence]] 证明，具体层 $H_a$ 由 [[88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy]] 引入。名称中的 jump system 指普通图灵跳跃的超限迭代，不是通常也称 hyperjump 的 Kleene $\\mathcal O$ 相对化算子。"},{"id":"ca39023cb294c484","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\exists!\\mathcal H\\;\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)$ 由 [[88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence]] 给出。"},{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\iota x\\,\\phi$ 的绑定、自由参数、代入及默认值约定完整导入 [[88-df-iota-operator]]；层级中的唯一性前提来自 [[88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence]]。"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-196","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-lem-classical-calculus-correctness.md]]\n[[88-lem-countable-syntax.md]]\n[[88-lem-finite-injury-verification.md]]\n[[88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence.md]]\n[[88-lem-numeral-functional-representation.md]]\n[[88-lem-oracle-enumeration.md]]\n[[88-lem-oracle-parameterization.md]]\n[[88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties.md]]"}],"outgoing":["6587ae27f7ed289f","b23177f17eeaa7a2","17e23d087321028e","c749f46fbad31f8b","20e88b72affa35d1"]}